{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JygwK2YAv5u1PYG5diVbxt","type":"tool_result","content":"1816:  marker(x, y, z = 0, o = {}) {\n2565:  cornerArea() {\n  cornerArea() {\n    const c = this._corner && this._corner.style.display !== 'none' ? this._corner : this.input._startEl; if (!c || !c.isConnected || !this.screen.canvas) return null;\n    const q = c.getBoundingClientRect(); if (!q.width) return null;\n    const a = this.input.screenPoint(q.left, q.top), b = this.input.screenPoint(q.right, q.bottom);\n    return { x0: a[0], y0: a[1], x1: b[0], y1: b[1] };\n424:- `r.marker(x, y, z = 0, o = {})`: an objective marker over a world point: a bobbing diamond (and its label) while it is on screen, an arrow at the screen's edge pointing to it while it is off (offscreen: false hides it then). o: { label, color: '#ffd040', offscreen: 'arrow' }","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7d7e0cb-a26c-4fe8-90f7-7d5024813af2","uuid":"b0de48a8-bfa6-4763-92b1-b6691a0fb76f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T05:37:40.429Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1816:  marker(x, y, z = 0, o = {}) {\n2565:  cornerArea() {\n  cornerArea() {\n    const c = this._corner && this._corner.style.display !== 'none' ? this._corner : this.input._startEl; if (!c || !c.isConnected || !this.screen.canvas) return null;\n    const q = c.getBoundingClientRect(); if (!q.width) return null;\n    const a = this.input.screenPoint(q.left, q.top), b = this.input.screenPoint(q.right, q.bottom);\n    return { x0: a[0], y0: a[1], x1: b[0], y1: b[1] };\n424:- `r.marker(x, y, z = 0, o = {})`: an objective marker over a world point: a bobbing diamond (and its label) while it is on screen, an arrow at the screen's edge pointing to it while it is off (offscreen: false hides it then). o: { label, color: '#ffd040', offscreen: 'arrow' }","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JygwK2YAv5u1PYG5diVbxt","permissio