{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The HTML exists in the folder root and exit-interview.json parses with every field answered, and the final reply contains all four sections. However, the condition requires every TASK.md feature to be implemented and verified, and the transcript does not establish that. Several TASK.md items were verified only by checks added or reworked after failing, notably the Bee win and Knot Cutter award. The Usage field is an estimate, which TASK.md permits. The Animalese voices and touch-only notice were checked by audio-level measurement and an emulated phone, not by inspecting the feature in play on a real device. The placeholder search only shows those words are absent. The transcript has a single full passing run of the final test command, 367 of 367, and no end-to-end run whose coverage was established in full against every TASK.md requirement."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7d7e0cb-a26c-4fe8-90f7-7d5024813af2","uuid":"0f22f182-98e2-43b3-bba1-3037743a8fee","timestamp":"2026-11-04T07:40:20.076Z","isSynthetic":true}
